  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Age**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Lay Me Down**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Just Because**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Ashland Breakdown**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2026-09-28** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 150 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The crowd chanted \"Jarrod Walker,\" followed by a \"Charge!\" tease intro crediting Tommy Walker [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2026-09-28**: taped by Brian Lee; transferred by Brian Lee; source: FOB/DFC/10'high DPA 4018 MMP-C (NOS/AM Excalibur II) & DPA 2015 (NOS/AM Sorcerer) > Mod Lunatec V3 (AES Out) > SD 788T @ 24/48 [1]. Also: Captured with DPA 4018 and DPA 2015 microphones, run through a Lunatec V3 into an SD 788T at 24-bit/48k; Brian Lee recorded and processed it in Sound Forge, then converted it to FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Pechanga Arena San Diego: [Billy Strings Fall 2026 | Pechanga Arena San Diego](https://pechangaarenasd.com/event/billy-strings/) [3]",
